OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly dry with some
OL,6,Fhazy sunny spells. Cloudier around the
OL,7,Fmiddle of the day with the odd light
OL,8,Fshower. Breezy along the coast.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FStaying mainly dry this
OL,11,Fevening before showery outbreaks of
OL,12,Frain push in from the south overnight.
OL,13,FThe odd heavy burst possible and
OL,14,Fremaining breezy around the coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FCloudy with patchy rain or
OL,17,Fshowers at first. Skies brightening at
OL,18,Ftimes in the afternoon but still the
OL,19,Fchance of the odd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
